    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_2c3885fd",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: nazi_rally; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a nighttime scene with a crowd of people silhouetted against a backdrop of burning swastikas, a symbol universally recognized as representing Nazism and the Holocaust. The text overlay 'nazi rally' explicitly labels the event. The overall intent is to portray or glorify a neo-Nazi or white supremacist gathering, which is inherently hateful as it directly invokes symbols and ideologies associated with genocide, racism, and extreme violence. The visual juxtaposition of the burning swastikas with the crowd creates a propagandistic and menacing tone, intended to evoke fear, reinforce extremist ideologies, or glorify hate. This content is explicitly hateful as it targets individuals and groups based on their ethnicity and political beliefs, and it promotes dangerous, historically violent ideologies.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_24876e1f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
