      "instance_name": "nazi_rally_scene",
      "label": "neo-Nazi rally with burning swastikas",
      "description": "A nighttime scene depicting a crowd of silhouetted people standing in front of burning swastikas. The crowd appears to be participating in a rally, with many raising their arms in a salute or solidarity gesture. The burning swastikas are the central visual focus, casting light and smoke against the dark sky. The text overlay 'nazi rally' explicitly labels the event. The overall composition creates a menacing, propagandistic atmosphere.",
