      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "nazi_symbol",
      "label": "Swastika as Nazi Symbol",
      "description": "The swastika is a symbol historically associated with the Nazi Party and the Holocaust. Its use in this context is not merely decorative but carries deep historical and political weight, representing genocide, racism, and extreme violence. Understanding this requires knowledge of 20th-century European history and the atrocities committed under Nazi rule.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_24876e1f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_54ccb5cf",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "neo_nazi_rally",
      "label": "Neo-Nazi Rally",
      "description": "A neo-Nazi rally is a modern gathering that promotes or glorifies the ideologies of Nazism, often involving symbols like the swastika, salutes, and chants. These events are illegal in many countries and are associated with hate crimes, white supremacy, and extremist political movements. The term 'neo-Nazi' implies a contemporary revival of Nazi ideology.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_24876e1f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_237b420d",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "holocaust",
      "label": "Holocaust",
      "description": "The Holocaust was the systematic, state-sponsored persecution and murder of six million Jews by Nazi Germany and its collaborators during World War II. It is the central historical event associated with the Nazi regime and the swastika. The image’s use of burning swastikas invokes this genocide, making the background knowledge of the Holocaust essential to understanding the meme’s hateful intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_24876e1f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8c33ccb5",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "white_supremacy",
      "label": "White Supremacy",
      "description": "White supremacy is a racist ideology that promotes the belief in the inherent superiority of white people over other races. It is the core ideology of neo-Nazi and other extremist groups. The image, by depicting a rally with swastikas and saluting crowds, implicitly references this ideology, which requires external knowledge to interpret the meme’s message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
