    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_c0a831da",
      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "hate",
      "label": "hateful emotion",
      "description": "The image expresses a hateful emotion through the visual depiction of a neo-Nazi rally with burning swastikas and silhouetted crowds raising their arms in a salute. The text overlay 'nazi rally' explicitly labels the event, reinforcing the hateful intent. The overall composition, including the use of the swastika as a hate symbol and the propagandistic atmosphere, evokes fear, intimidation, and glorification of extremist ideologies rooted in white supremacy and genocide. This emotion is not expressed by individuals' facial expressions (as faces are obscured) but is conveyed through the symbolic and contextual elements of the scene.",
