      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "The text 'nazi rally' maps to the visual scene of the neo-Nazi rally with burning swastikas.",
      "description": "The textual label 'nazi rally' explicitly identifies and categorizes the visual scene depicted in the image. The visual material — the silhouetted crowd, the burning swastikas, and the overall atmosphere — is directly mapped onto the textual label, which serves as a direct semantic annotation of the scene. This is a clear analogical mapping where the text functions as a label or descriptor for the visual entity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
